<p>Hi,</p>

<p>Your email was bounced because this address is not authorized to publish on this blog.</p>

<% if @allowlist.any? %>
  <p>Authorized senders: <%= @allowlist.join(", ") %></p>
<% else %>
  <p>The allowlist (MAILPRESS_ALLOWED_SENDERS) is empty on the server, which means
  only the deployment environment itself is misconfigured.</p>
<% end %>
